    "bbox": [
      71.76,
      573.6,
      310.42,
      628.55
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Dodamgastenna; Land use; Estate; Claimant:Government; First Claimant: N.S.J.S. Karunarathna, Yodagama,Pinnawala and I. Prasanna Gunathillake, Wagolla,Rambukkana; Extent: 0.6454 Hectare.",
