      637.92,
      310.68,
      681.59
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing , before me at Rambukkana Divisional Secretariaton 26/07/2017, at 10.00 a.m.",
